WEBVTT

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:11.610
I share my unstoppable curiosity with you.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:17.410
I'm still able to run through the fog...

00:00:17.429 --> 00:00:21.238
...because I know that you're here for me.

00:00:21.238 --> 00:00:28.885
I guess the shape of happiness is different for everyone...

00:00:28.893 --> 00:00:33.164
...however, I know it's boring when I'm alone...

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:35.050
But, with you...

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.160
...it's like a mystery!

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.720
It's an enchanting future, where...

00:00:42.887 --> 00:00:47.440
...in order for me to be strong, it's always you...

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:51.820
...that I can continue to depend on, right?

00:00:51.841 --> 00:00:53.421
Just to survive!

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.360
Stumped Q? Don't lose your way!

00:00:55.362 --> 00:00:57.225
Take this moment...

00:00:57.225 --> 00:01:00.820
...to fix your gaze and charge on ahead!

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:03.059
Eternally, we'll always be together...

00:01:03.059 --> 00:01:04.870
...searching and pursuing...

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:08.580
...the meaning of it all.

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:10.710
Truth is nothing but a labyrinth...

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.420
...that we try to continue through...

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:16.126
...especially when we are hurt.

00:01:16.126 --> 00:01:18.298
I'll take you, so come this way.

00:01:18.292 --> 00:01:20.133
I'm certain that, on that day...

00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:24.042
...I'll see your smile, face to face!

00:01:31.592 --> 00:01:34.470
Invited to a seance by Ichinose Kaoru-san...

00:01:34.595 --> 00:01:39.809
...a classmate of Kyuu's from middle
school, Q Class joined hands...

00:01:40.101 --> 00:01:45.106
...in a circle around the spirit medium,
Asakura Kousci-san...

00:01:45.356 --> 00:01:46.899
...and began the ceremony.

00:01:54.031 --> 00:01:55.658
W-What are you doing?

00:01:56.868 --> 00:02:00.413
But during the seance, Asakura-san
was murdered.

00:02:02.331 --> 00:02:06.169
All twelve of us were joining hands.

00:02:06.669 --> 00:02:10.465
How is it possible to kill Asakura-san-san,
when she was in the middle?

00:02:10.506 --> 00:02:14.969
In addition, Kusaka Sachio-san was
found dead while the police...

00:02:15.136 --> 00:02:18.514
...were inspecting the crime scene, and
the case was tossed into confusion.

00:02:19.223 --> 00:02:21.017
It must be the spirit of Hanayo-san!

00:02:21.809 --> 00:02:23.978
Hanayo-san is angry at Sachio!

00:02:24.437 --> 00:02:27.732
However, Ryu-kun saw through the
trick involved in this murder.

00:02:28.191 --> 00:02:29.025
And, then...

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:32.445
I know...

00:02:36.991 --> 00:02:39.577
...the trick used in this murder, and...

00:02:40.036 --> 00:02:41.704
...who the true culprit is.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:43.498
What?

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:45.541
The trick used in this murder?

00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:47.835
You know who the true culprit is, you say?

00:02:48.419 --> 00:02:50.296
You're kidding! You're kidding, right?

00:02:50.546 --> 00:02:53.132
I thought you were the slowest one in the group!

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:56.636
So, I'm not the only one that thinks that.

00:02:57.053 --> 00:02:57.762
Kyuu!

00:02:57.845 --> 00:02:58.471
Right!

00:02:59.096 --> 00:03:00.139
There are three hints!

00:03:00.515 --> 00:03:03.267
First, the victim's clothing.

00:03:03.434 --> 00:03:07.021
Second, the conversation recorded on the tape.

00:03:07.605 --> 00:03:13.903
And the third one is the similarities between the
circles that Kazuma input on his computer.

00:03:14.195 --> 00:03:17.782
What does that mean? I don't understand
a word you're saying!

00:03:18.407 --> 00:03:20.618
Don't say such random things, you brat!

00:03:20.993 --> 00:03:23.120
Even if you are from a detective club...

00:03:23.579 --> 00:03:25.540
...you shouldn't say random things!

00:03:25.623 --> 00:03:30.545
That's right, Detective! Why listen to these brats?

00:03:30.795 --> 00:03:33.422
Actually, I would like to hear what he has to say.

00:03:33.881 --> 00:03:39.303
At one point, I was named a suspect by
the suspicious assistant next to me.

00:03:39.637 --> 00:03:45.017
I was too! To begin with, Asakura-Sensei
hired me just a few days ago.

00:03:45.393 --> 00:03:47.770
My regular occupation is a magician!
I have no reason to...

00:03:47.937 --> 00:03:52.942
Let's not anger Hanayo-san's spirit again.

00:03:53.234 --> 00:03:55.695
Someone else may end up like Sachio...

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:57.488
It wasn't my mother's spirit!

00:03:57.864 --> 00:04:00.241
My mother would never murder someone...

00:04:00.533 --> 00:04:02.159
...even if she was a spirit!

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:07.832
Besides, Kyuu-kun said to me earlier...

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.126
..."Let's find your mother's will."

00:04:10.751 --> 00:04:12.253
"If we find that will...

00:04:12.461 --> 00:04:16.090
...I'm sure. it will have instructions that
will satisfy your whole family.“

00:04:17.049 --> 00:04:18.551
So, I...

00:04:21.679 --> 00:04:23.973
Please continue, Kyuu-kun!

00:04:27.101 --> 00:04:27.977
lchinose...

00:04:29.812 --> 00:04:33.983
What I'm about to say may
be heartbreaking to you.

00:04:34.817 --> 00:04:36.903
But, by telling you...

00:04:37.278 --> 00:04:40.239
...I believe it will result in your happiness!

00:04:40.907 --> 00:04:41.991
No, I'm certain of it!

00:04:42.325 --> 00:04:43.284
So, I'll continue.

00:04:43.993 --> 00:04:45.161
O-Okay.

00:04:45.953 --> 00:04:47.371
There's only one answer.

00:04:49.707 --> 00:04:52.043
Okay, let's hear what you have to say.

00:04:52.335 --> 00:04:53.836
Let's start with the first hint.

00:04:54.211 --> 00:04:56.547
The victim's clothing, right?

00:04:56.839 --> 00:04:57.506
Yes.

00:04:58.674 --> 00:05:00.384
As Kinta said earlier...

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:04.680
...no blood was splattered when the victim was stabbed with the knife...

00:05:05.097 --> 00:05:10.394
...which means the perpetrator planned the
murder knowing what the victim would wear.

00:05:10.603 --> 00:05:14.357
Having said that, the reason
why the murderer decided...

00:05:14.523 --> 00:05:17.485
...to kill Asakura-san during the
seance when it was dark was...

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:20.780
...because of the long muffler she was wearing!

00:05:26.661 --> 00:05:27.620
<i>That’s right!</i>

00:05:27.954 --> 00:05:29.372
The muffler?

00:05:29.497 --> 00:05:30.873
Oh, I understand now!

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:33.334
She was strangled with the muffler!

00:05:33.459 --> 00:05:34.919
Strangled, huh?

00:05:35.336 --> 00:05:37.421
But, I thought the victim was stabbed to death.

00:05:37.713 --> 00:05:38.506
Right?

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:40.383
It's a time-difference trick.

00:05:40.591 --> 00:05:41.968
Time-difference?

00:05:42.343 --> 00:05:46.889
Remember, the victim made a
groan when she collapsed.

00:05:47.431 --> 00:05:49.016
W-What are you doing?

00:05:51.644 --> 00:05:52.895
W-What?

00:05:55.481 --> 00:05:57.233
That's true, but...

00:05:57.692 --> 00:06:01.362
We all assumed she was killed then, but...

00:06:02.071 --> 00:06:03.864
...she was still alive at that point.

00:06:04.407 --> 00:06:08.077
But, she was unconscious after
being strangled by the muffler!

00:06:08.285 --> 00:06:09.870
Eh? What did you say?

00:06:10.037 --> 00:06:11.914
The real murder was committed later.

00:06:12.456 --> 00:06:16.585
In other words, the murder was it
committed in the short time...

00:06:17.003 --> 00:06:21.048
...between releasing our hands
and turning on the lights!

00:06:21.507 --> 00:06:24.927
Then, there should be some
sign of strangulation.

00:06:25.094 --> 00:06:28.806
The muffler is thick and soft, so it's very likely...

00:06:28.973 --> 00:06:31.976
...to not leave a mark on the victim's neck.

00:06:32.435 --> 00:06:36.647
Regardless, a person fault!
fall unconscious just by]...

00:06:36.814 --> 00:06:39.608
...pressing hard upon the carotid
for more than ten seconds. .

00:06:40.526 --> 00:06:44.655
But, how did the perpetrator strangle
the victim with the muffler?

00:06:44.989 --> 00:06:47.324
Everyone was still joining hands.

00:06:47.825 --> 00:06:49.368
It's impossible.

00:06:49.577 --> 00:06:50.369
It's possible...

00:06:51.328 --> 00:06:52.038
...with your mouth.

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:54.582
Using your mouth instead of your hands!

00:06:55.041 --> 00:06:56.042
M-Mouth?

00:06:58.377 --> 00:07:00.046
You've seen it on television, right?

00:07:00.671 --> 00:07:03.591
People pulling a truck using their mouth.

00:07:06.135 --> 00:07:09.847
The gnawing strength of the average
male is well over seventy kilograms.

00:07:10.306 --> 00:07:13.934
As for grasping power, the average male
can manage forty or fifty kilograms, so...

00:07:14.101 --> 00:07:18.064
...strangling someone using your
mouth is quite an easy task.

00:07:18.981 --> 00:07:19.899
Like this?

00:07:21.859 --> 00:07:25.821
To be honest, Kinta's leg
theory gave me the hint.

00:07:25.946 --> 00:07:29.158
But, how do you strangle someone like this?

00:07:29.533 --> 00:07:31.160
It's impossible to do that alone.

00:07:32.286 --> 00:07:33.120
That's right.

00:07:33.454 --> 00:07:36.874
That's why there are two perpetrators.

00:07:37.583 --> 00:07:38.417
Two?

00:07:39.043 --> 00:07:41.962
The perpetrators took advantage of the time
between the candle was blown out...

00:07:42.213 --> 00:07:44.632
...and before everyone joined hands.

00:07:45.341 --> 00:07:49.136
They each grabbed an end of
the muffler, bit down on it...

00:07:49.178 --> 00:07:51.555
...Leaned their body forward, drew
back to the circle, and...

00:07:52.223 --> 00:07:55.101
...once they had backed far enough away...

00:07:55.643 --> 00:07:57.228
...they pulled back on the muffler.

00:08:01.148 --> 00:08:03.984
The victim fell unconscious
and collapsed to the floor.

00:08:05.528 --> 00:08:10.032
When the perpetrators realized she had
gone limp, they leaned forward again...

00:08:10.783 --> 00:08:14.078
...waited for someone to notice the abnormal situation, and ask to have the lights turned on.

00:08:14.787 --> 00:08:17.873
Then, when everyone freed their
hands, they took a chance...

00:08:18.207 --> 00:08:22.086
...used the muffler to find the
victim in the dark, and...

00:08:23.629 --> 00:08:26.507
...stabbed her with the knife through the heart.

00:08:30.594 --> 00:08:31.887
So, that's what you meant!

00:08:32.012 --> 00:08:33.973
It was a clever time-difference trick.

00:08:34.682 --> 00:08:37.768
S-So, Kyuu-kun, who are the perpetrators?

00:08:37.768 --> 00:08:38.102
The answer to that...

00:08:41.397 --> 00:08:46.610
The second hint! The conversation
recorded on the tape, huh?

00:08:46.735 --> 00:08:51.365
But, only Kaoru and the Kusakas
are talking on the tape...

00:08:51.657 --> 00:08:54.201
...and there weren't any suspicious sounds on it.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:55.578
It's just the opposite.

00:08:56.162 --> 00:08:59.498
Ichinose and the Kasaka's weren't
talking excessively.

00:09:00.374 --> 00:09:03.627
It just felt like that because
no one else had spoken.

00:09:03.961 --> 00:09:05.212
W-What?

00:09:05.629 --> 00:09:08.549
Nabeshima-san and Fujisawa-san
were a bit reluctant...

00:09:08.799 --> 00:09:10.885
...but they still had something to say.

00:09:11.051 --> 00:09:17.308
However, there were two people
who didn't say a word...

00:09:17.474 --> 00:09:18.809
...until everyone released hands.

00:09:19.185 --> 00:09:22.730
Isn't that right, Tomohiko-san and Akihiko-san?

00:09:23.022 --> 00:09:26.066
I-It can't be! My brothers?

00:09:26.901 --> 00:09:27.860
Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:27.985 --> 00:09:30.279
There's no way we would do that!

00:09:37.369 --> 00:09:38.454
In the dark...

00:09:39.163 --> 00:09:41.415
...while everyone else was confused...

00:09:42.041 --> 00:09:44.335
...you two were unusually quiet.

00:09:45.085 --> 00:09:51.800
And that's because both of you had the
ends of the muffler in your mouth!

00:09:53.886 --> 00:09:57.598
Asakura-san‘s true murderers aren't evil
spirits like we were meant to believe.

00:09:59.725 --> 00:10:00.726
It was you two!

00:10:04.063 --> 00:10:07.566
Is that really true? Tomohiko-niisan?
Akihiko-niisan?

00:10:07.816 --> 00:10:08.943
N-No!

00:10:09.026 --> 00:10:11.612
I clearly remember...

00:10:11.987 --> 00:10:13.822
...the third hint Kyuu mentioned.

00:10:14.073 --> 00:10:15.741
The similarities between the two circles.

00:10:16.242 --> 00:10:22.665
That is, in the original circle and the
one formed at Ryu-kun's request...

00:10:22.957 --> 00:10:24.500
...Tomohiko-san and Akihiko-san...

00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:28.420
...were in exactly the same spot in both circles.

00:10:28.963 --> 00:10:31.090
The 12 o'clock spot and the 6 o'clock spot.

00:10:31.757 --> 00:10:35.094
That was because they had to be opposite each other...

00:10:35.427 --> 00:10:38.222
...in order to strangle the victim with the muffler.

00:10:42.309 --> 00:10:43.519
Brothers...

00:10:45.229 --> 00:10:47.648
Do you have any real evidence
that we're the perpetrators?

00:10:48.065 --> 00:10:50.859
Circumstantial evidence isn't enough, you know!

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:52.611
You need some real, physical evidence!

00:10:53.028 --> 00:10:55.990
Physical evidence would still be on the muffler.

00:10:56.073 --> 00:10:56.907
W-What?

00:10:57.449 --> 00:10:59.201
If Kyuu's deduction is correct...

00:10:59.535 --> 00:11:03.372
...your saliva should still be
on the muffler's ornaments.

00:11:04.206 --> 00:11:06.417
If we put that through a DNA test...

00:11:07.167 --> 00:11:09.628
...we will know whose saliva it is.

00:11:17.344 --> 00:11:19.596
N-No! It wasn't us!

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:21.223
They made that up!

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:23.809
He's right! Who would believe that brat's theory?

00:11:24.059 --> 00:11:25.769
That's enough, both of you!

00:11:26.312 --> 00:11:28.522
Do you realize what you've done?

00:11:32.401 --> 00:11:34.069
W-What now?

00:11:34.528 --> 00:11:38.782
This is the letter of request supposedly
sent from your mother to Asakura-san.

00:11:39.825 --> 00:11:42.911
But, the letter has one defining,
but unnatural feature.

00:11:43.412 --> 00:11:44.747
Solving that mystery...

00:11:45.998 --> 00:11:48.375
...will reveal the hidden truth behind this seance.

00:11:49.376 --> 00:11:52.004
But, I don't want to go into that if possible.

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:56.759
If you two just confess to your
crime, I'll keep this a secret.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:03.307
Kyuu-kun?

00:12:07.311 --> 00:12:08.812
G-Go ahead!

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:10.689
What truth are you talking about?

00:12:12.024 --> 00:12:13.734
Do you really want to know...

00:12:14.234 --> 00:12:16.695
...the hidden truth behind this case?

00:12:40.403 --> 00:12:41.404
C-Could it be...

00:12:41.988 --> 00:12:43.114
...the way it's folded? .

00:12:43.406 --> 00:12:47.702
The way its folded? It's just a typical fold.

00:12:47.952 --> 00:12:52.373
Then, fold them and try to put
them into the envelope.

00:12:52.748 --> 00:12:53.416
Huh?

00:13:00.339 --> 00:13:02.800
It won't fit m-the envelope!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.051
W-What?

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:05.803
It's true!

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:07.096
Thai's right.

00:13:08.055 --> 00:13:11.767
Had it been opened with scissors, the letter...

00:13:12.184 --> 00:13:13.769
...would have been cut, too.

00:13:14.478 --> 00:13:17.398
As you can see, it hasn't been
folded any other way.

00:13:18.482 --> 00:13:23.362
That means this letter wasn't originally
sent in this envelope.

00:13:23.738 --> 00:13:25.781
W-What does that mean, Kyuu-kun?

00:13:26.282 --> 00:13:29.368
This letter isn't something your mother...

00:13:29.577 --> 00:13:32.788
...sent to Asakura Kousci-san before she died.

00:13:33.748 --> 00:13:35.374
Please look at the postmark dale.

00:13:37.251 --> 00:13:43.424
It's not visible because the envelope is cut.

00:13:44.175 --> 00:13:48.095
She probably sent multiple empty
envelopes like this one...

00:13:48.554 --> 00:13:53.017
...to get one with the postmark date in that spot.

00:13:53.309 --> 00:13:54.769
W-What do you mean?

00:13:54.852 --> 00:13:59.106
The handwriting in the letter, and even
on the envelope, is my mother's!

00:13:59.273 --> 00:14:01.859
There's no mistake that she sent
it before the airplane crash!

00:14:01.942 --> 00:14:02.818
No.

00:14:03.986 --> 00:14:06.280
The reason why the postmark
on the envelope was cut off...

00:14:06.864 --> 00:14:09.158
...is because the letter was sent recently.

00:14:10.367 --> 00:14:11.327
If that is true...

00:14:12.536 --> 00:14:16.749
...then your mother wasn't killed
in an airplane crash.

00:14:16.749 --> 00:14:18.209
I

00:14:18.209 --> 00:14:19.460
T-That's ridiculous!

00:14:19.502 --> 00:14:21.504
All the passengers were killed...

00:14:21.504 --> 00:14:23.172
But, she was alive!

00:14:23.422 --> 00:14:24.757
That's not possible!

00:14:25.299 --> 00:14:28.219
If she was alive, wouldn't she return to us?

00:14:28.677 --> 00:14:31.263
If she didn't need the life insurance money.

00:14:32.681 --> 00:14:37.228
Your mother's company almost went bankrupt
because of your brothers, right?

00:14:38.062 --> 00:14:41.607
But, the life insurance money
revived the company.

00:14:42.358 --> 00:14:45.653
That's why she couldn't return alive.

00:14:46.362 --> 00:14:49.240
T-Then, where's my mother?

00:14:49.448 --> 00:14:52.785
Did Asakura-san know my mother was alive?

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:54.161
Ichinose...

00:14:56.872 --> 00:15:01.043
Well, let me ask you this.

00:15:01.585 --> 00:15:06.006
Why do you think you heard your mother's voice
and saw her handwriting on the wall?

00:15:06.465 --> 00:15:07.174
Eh?

00:15:07.883 --> 00:15:10.803
I-It wasn't the spirit?

00:15:11.303 --> 00:15:15.266
Why did Asakura-san come to your house...

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:18.936
...and attempt to recall your mother's spirit?

00:15:20.437 --> 00:15:21.564
There's only one answer.

00:15:22.106 --> 00:15:24.650
The spirit medium, Asakura Kousei...

00:15:25.151 --> 00:15:26.902
...was actually your mother!

00:15:44.545 --> 00:15:45.546
No way...

00:15:46.255 --> 00:15:47.506
Then, my brother...

00:15:48.132 --> 00:15:49.216
...we...

00:15:50.009 --> 00:15:51.552
Don't be fooled by him, Akihiko!

00:15:52.094 --> 00:15:54.388
That brat's trying to trick us!

00:15:54.763 --> 00:15:56.765
I won't listen to this nonsense!

00:15:56.849 --> 00:15:58.350
Please, that's enough!

00:16:01.478 --> 00:16:03.439
N-Nabeshimaesan...

00:16:04.106 --> 00:16:06.567
What Kyuu-san said is the truth.

00:16:06.859 --> 00:16:08.027
What do you mean?

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:11.238
How is someone who died in
a crash capable of that?

00:16:12.406 --> 00:16:16.994
Before the accident, Ichinose-san
attempted to save the company...

00:16:17.244 --> 00:16:20.748
...from bankruptcy by flying to
Osaka to ask the company's...

00:16:21.165 --> 00:16:23.167
...last business partner for debt relief.

00:16:27.004 --> 00:16:29.465
However, they rejected her
request over the phone...

00:16:29.506 --> 00:16:33.928
...and she gave her plane ticket to a young
lady who was on the waiting list for a seat.

00:16:35.346 --> 00:16:36.722
Then, the plane...

00:16:37.181 --> 00:16:38.849
<i>The passengers were as follows</i>

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:40.976
<i>Andau Hiroshige-san</i>

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:42.895
<i>Igawa Haruki</i>

00:16:43.771 --> 00:16:45.064
<i>Ichinse Hanayo-san</i>

00:16:45.898 --> 00:16:47.233
T-That can't be!

00:16:48.025 --> 00:16:49.235
<i>Endou Fujiko-san</i>

00:16:49.985 --> 00:16:51.362
<i>Obana Konoha-san</i>

00:16:53.739 --> 00:16:54.531
Hello?

00:16:55.449 --> 00:16:57.952
Manager, is it really you?

00:16:58.661 --> 00:17:02.915
As Kyuu-san said, in order to save the
company with her life insurance...

00:17:03.165 --> 00:17:07.002
...she continued to make it look
as though she had died.

00:17:07.711 --> 00:17:10.965
With that decision, she had plastic surgery...

00:17:11.048 --> 00:17:13.842
...and managed the company from
the shadows through me.

00:17:14.343 --> 00:17:18.264
Tomohiko-san, Akihiko-san...
My manager was...

00:17:18.305 --> 00:17:20.015
Stop!

00:17:20.891 --> 00:17:22.476
Please stop!

00:17:22.726 --> 00:17:23.394
Brother!

00:17:23.978 --> 00:17:25.604
I killed her.

00:17:25.938 --> 00:17:29.024
I stabbed my own mother with
a knife. With my own hands...

00:17:42.037 --> 00:17:42.705
Hey.

00:17:43.205 --> 00:17:45.791
Call Headquarters and have
them check the victim.

00:17:46.208 --> 00:17:47.001
Yes, sir.

00:18:01.974 --> 00:18:02.891
Brother...

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.561
Don't call me your brother.

00:18:06.061 --> 00:18:07.604
We're murderers.

00:18:07.896 --> 00:18:08.772
We killed our mother...

00:18:08.981 --> 00:18:10.691
...and Aunt Sachio.

00:18:12.109 --> 00:18:13.819
Did you kill Aunt Sachio...

00:18:14.194 --> 00:18:19.575
...because she was trying to take me
as well as our mother's fortune?

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.993
That's not all.

00:18:21.785 --> 00:18:23.746
I bumped into Her during the seance.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:29.418
She realized that I was the murderer...

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.880
...and threatened to inform the police...

00:18:33.505 --> 00:18:37.760
...unless we gave up the right's
to our mother's fortune.

00:18:39.011 --> 00:18:41.347
T-There's no way Sachio...

00:18:42.681 --> 00:18:47.478
Why didn't you tell the police?
Then, she wouldn't have died!

00:18:47.811 --> 00:18:50.773
Because Shouhei-san is an executive
officer of the company.

00:18:51.398 --> 00:18:53.776
The death of the company president
is quite a scandal.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.487
But, if the media found out that the
murderer was the president's son...

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:58.697
...the company would be severely damaged.

00:18:59.323 --> 00:19:01.325
From the view of Shouhei-san and Sachio-san...

00:19:01.575 --> 00:19:05.245
...blaming the crime on evil spirits
was the best choice, was it not?

00:19:10.042 --> 00:19:10.959
Uncle...

00:19:20.386 --> 00:19:23.514
Kaoru, we have no right being your brothers!

00:19:24.139 --> 00:19:26.767
Act as though we never existed!

00:19:27.017 --> 00:19:29.395
We just want you to be happy!

00:19:34.149 --> 00:19:35.734
No!

00:19:35.901 --> 00:19:37.236
What are you thinking?

00:19:53.043 --> 00:19:56.296
Ootaguro-san, you're good despite your looks.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.340
T-Thanks.

00:20:02.261 --> 00:20:05.139
You two were wrong to commit that crime.

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:08.851
But, if you care for your sister...

00:20:09.518 --> 00:20:12.020
...you should atone your sins.

00:20:20.654 --> 00:20:21.405
Is that so?

00:20:22.448 --> 00:20:23.615
Nice work.

00:20:24.408 --> 00:20:27.327
It was nothing, they did it all by themselves...

00:20:31.582 --> 00:20:32.666
...it'll be hard for them.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.084
I'm sure.

00:20:35.544 --> 00:20:38.130
However, it's a wall...

00:20:38.505 --> 00:20:40.966
...one must surmount to become a detective.

00:20:53.896 --> 00:20:54.730
Kyuu-kun?

00:21:00.235 --> 00:21:02.738
I found your mother's will.

00:21:04.072 --> 00:21:07.409
It was inside the picture frame on the
mantle of the living room fireplace.

00:21:08.535 --> 00:21:10.245
I see.

00:21:17.461 --> 00:21:20.839
"Dear Tomohikd, Akihiko, and Kaoru...

00:21:21.632 --> 00:21:23.634
I was constantly busy...

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:26.762
...and I wasn't able to be there
for you as a mother, but...

00:21:27.471 --> 00:21:29.473
...if something were to happen to me...

00:21:29.598 --> 00:21:34.102
...I've written this will so that I
can leave behind the words...

00:21:34.311 --> 00:21:36.146
...that I wasn't able to say as a mother."

00:21:37.231 --> 00:21:41.735
"Tomohiko, I always used harsh words on you...

00:21:42.236 --> 00:21:44.821
...because you were the eldest son, but...

00:21:44.988 --> 00:21:46.406
...I'm sorry if I hurt you because of that."

00:21:47.199 --> 00:21:50.118
"Please return to being the reliable Tomohiko...

00:21:50.244 --> 00:21:52.496
...that took care of Kaoru...

00:21:52.579 --> 00:21:56.124
...while I was at work...

00:21:56.333 --> 00:21:57.668
...knowing she had a weak body."

00:21:59.253 --> 00:22:00.254
"Akihiko...

00:22:00.712 --> 00:22:05.133
...I was heartbroken to see you change
from your true, kind self...

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:06.718
...in the days that my company grew."

00:22:07.511 --> 00:22:10.305
"I was intent on working hard for our family...

00:22:10.556 --> 00:22:13.016
...but it tore apart our family instead."

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:15.811
"However, it's not too late."

00:22:16.436 --> 00:22:20.691
"I'll be praying from heaven
that this will be a start...

00:22:20.941 --> 00:22:23.026
...to stronger ties between the three of you."

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:25.904
"And Kaoru...

00:22:27.197 --> 00:22:32.119
...it's regretful that I must leave a
young student like you behind."

00:22:32.869 --> 00:22:35.622
"But, I believe a strong-willed girl like you...

00:22:35.747 --> 00:22:38.875
...will have no problem supporting
the bonds with your brothers."

00:22:39.793 --> 00:22:42.921
"Please, remember me sometimes."

00:22:44.089 --> 00:22:47.926
"I left this will inside the picture frame...

00:22:48.218 --> 00:22:51.930
...to strengthen the feeling of the
four of us in that picture."

00:23:04.735 --> 00:23:07.779
She didn't write anything about
the fortune after all.

00:23:12.784 --> 00:23:14.828
I have to show this to my brothers.

00:23:21.043 --> 00:23:22.002
Thank you.

00:23:37.289 --> 00:23:40.466
The Sun is setting in a red glow...

00:23:41.057 --> 00:23:43.598
...as it follows me.

00:23:43.955 --> 00:23:46.723
Along this deserted beach...

00:23:46.723 --> 00:23:50.693
...I walk alone once more.

00:23:50.706 --> 00:23:54.075
I can't continue to hold in...

00:23:54.697 --> 00:23:57.090
...the tears that should pour out.

00:23:57.738 --> 00:24:00.167
Why have these memories...

00:24:00.169 --> 00:24:03.699
...become so wonderful?

00:24:04.270 --> 00:24:09.266
Ah... Like an ocean wave, I return to you...

00:24:09.516 --> 00:24:12.039
...because I'm so in love.

00:24:12.772 --> 00:24:15.757
And, now my heart...

00:24:15.757 --> 00:24:17.900
...is heavy with pain.

00:24:18.854 --> 00:24:21.794
Reflections of a bright rainbow...

00:24:21.928 --> 00:24:26.057
...shine on the distant shores of yesterday.

00:24:26.397 --> 00:24:30.028
I'll never forget those days...

00:24:30.035 --> 00:24:35.121
...and I long to see you again.

00:24:39.779 --> 00:24:42.406
A missing young doctor is found...

00:24:42.907 --> 00:24:45.201
...thirty meters underwater in a locked room.

00:24:46.452 --> 00:24:48.704
Was this really an accident?

00:24:49.622 --> 00:24:51.958
Q Class's bright reasoning ignites the ocean!

00:24:53.000 --> 00:24:54.252
There's only one answer!

00:24:56.837 --> 00:24:58.923
Kyuu, is Kaoru doing okay?

00:24:59.090 --> 00:25:01.926
Yeah, she sounded alright
when I called yesterday.

00:25:02.301 --> 00:25:03.719
She said to give her regards to all of you.

00:25:04.011 --> 00:25:06.597
She's still kind enough to care for others
in these difficult times for her!

00:25:08.140 --> 00:25:10.017
She's a good girl!

00:25:10.047 --> 00:25:12.047
You faces are drooping.
